<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Neuhaus shares to begin trading March 4.</title>
<headline>Belgian Neuhaus shares to begin trading March 4.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian chocolate praline maker  Neuhaus will begin trading on the Brussels bourse on March 4 rather than March 10 as originally planned, the stock exchange said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering of Neuhaus shares, lead managed by Petercam, was closed early on Tuesday after the offer was 15 times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
